;. /propose_instruction_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition propose_instruction
  ;= Propose an instruction change from lessons
    This flow returns native values. Use the retain_result writer for a standalone occurrence. Compose project_result when a Nenex document is wanted. Publish the named child flows before publishing this composition; their exact definitions are captured.

    ;@ /flow/input lessons
    ;= lessons

    ;@ /flow/input sources
    ;= sources

    ;@ /flow/input provider
    ;= provider

    ;@ /flow/step task ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/instruction
    ;@ /flow/bind pages document
    ;@ /flow/bind sources sources
    ;@ /flow/bind context lessons
    ;= task

    ;@ /flow/step answered ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/interactive_requests
    ;@ /flow/bind tasks task
    ;@ /flow/bind provider provider
    ;= answered

    ;@ /flow/step result ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/results
    ;@ /flow/bind responses answered
    ;= result

    ;@ /flow/result result
    ;= Propose an instruction change from lessons result

    ;@ /flow/page /
    ;= Propose an instruction change from lessons
      Use the supplied lessons and current instructions. Return trigger, change, exception and note. Propose one small actionable change, grounded in the observation and counterexample. Explain when it must not apply. Do not modify instructions, publish a procedure or claim adoption.
